<title>USA: InteliData Technologies names Hillyard CFO.</title>
<headline>InteliData Technologies names Hillyard CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>InteliData Technologies Corp said it named John Hillyard as Chief Financial Officer.</p>
<p>Hillyard comes to InteliData with broad experience as CFO in the electronic commerce, transaction processing and computer retailing industries. Most recently he was Executive Vice President and CFO of Vision Technologies, a personal computer manufacturer with nationwide distribution through office superstores and consumer electronics superstores.</p>
</text>
